WEBVTT

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.560
We need to toughen them up
so they're ready for the real world!"

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.096
But that's like saying
to the parent of a two-year-old,

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.616
"Don't let Johnny nap,

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.056
or he won't be ready for kindergarten."

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.280
(Laughter)

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.776
Delaying start times also presents
many logistical challenges.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.176
Not just for students and their families,

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.576
but for communities as a whole.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.176
Updating bus routes,

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.256
increased transportation costs,

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.816
impact on sports,

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.256
care before or after school.

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:02.856
These are the same concerns
that come up in district after district,